ovable payments with Vatly","\u002Fintegrations\u002Flovable","4.integrations\u002F1.lovable",{"title":288,"path":289,"stem":290},"Bolt payments with Vatly","\u002Fintegrations\u002Fbolt","4.integrations\u002F2.bolt",{"id":292,"title":14,"body":293,"description":569,"extension":570,"links":571,"meta":572,"navigation":501,"path":15,"seo":573,"stem":16,"__hash__":574},"docs\u002F1.guides\u002F1.quickstart.md",{"type":294,"value":295,"toc":564},"minimark",[296,308,313,317,373,378,382,385,523,528,532,535,560],[297,298,299,300,307],"note",{},"Before you can make requests to the Vatly API, you will need to grab your\nAPI key from your dashboard. You find it under ",[301,302,306],"a",{"href":303,"rel":304},"https:\u002F\u002Fmy.vatly.com",[305],"nofollow","Developers » API keys",".",[309,310,312],"h2",{"id":311},"choose-your-client","Choose your client",[314,315,316],"p",{},"Before making your first API request, you need to pick which API client you will use. In addition to good ol' cURL HTTP requests, Vatly offers clients for JavaScript, Python, and PHP. In the following example, you can see how to install each client.",[318,319,321,352],"code-group",{"sync":320},"client",[322,323,329],"pre",{"className":324,"code":325,"filename":326,"language":327,"meta":328,"style":328},"language-bash shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","# cURL is most likely already installed on your machine\ncurl --version\n","cURL","bash","",[330,331,332,341],"code",{"__ignoreMap":328},[333,334,337],"span",{"class":335,"line":336},"line",1,[333,338,340],{"class":339},"sHwdD","# cURL is most likely already installed on your machine\n",[333,342,344,348],{"class":335,"line":343},2,[333,345,347],{"class":346},"sBMFI","curl",[333,349,351],{"class":350},"sfazB"," --version\n",[322,353,355],{"className":324,"code":354,"filename":119,"language":327,"meta":328,"style":328},"# Install the Vatly PHP SDK\ncomposer require vatly\u002Fvatly-api-php\n",[330,356,357,362